# EEG-CLIP++ Implementation Plan

## Overview
Upgrade the existing EEG-CLIP codebase to EEG-CLIP++ with four major improvements, matching the user's "concrete combined proposal":

1. **SigLIP sigmoid loss** (replaces InfoNCE to handle false negatives from near-duplicate reports)
2. **LLM-extracted structured labels as auxiliary heads** (multi-label classification heads on EEG embeddings)
3. **Channel-aware EEG encoder with window-level attention pooling** (electrode-position embeddings + attention across windows)
4. **Learned prompt embeddings for zero-shot** (CoOp-style prompt tuning)

