1. `models/losses.py` — standalone, no dependencies
2. `data/structured_labels.py` — standalone report parsing
3. `models/channel_aware_encoder.py` — depends only on config
4. `models/prompt_learner.py` — depends on text encoder
5. `config.py` — add all new config fields
6. `models/eeg_clip.py` — integrate into `EEGCLIPPlusPlus`
7. `data/dataset.py` — add structured labels to items
8. `train.py` — new training loop
9. `evaluate.py` — new evaluation with learned prompts
